{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は現在期間限定で配信されている"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16thアンダー曲「ブランコ」の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVのオフショットを載せたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/11/04/7027923/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16thのフォーメーションはこちら！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世がセンターです\\( ˆ ˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は前回と同じ、2列目の端。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この位置で私に出来ることを考えながら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと前へ出れるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も頑張っていきたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"端なので皆さんからは比較的"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見やすい位置になってると思うので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいパフォーマンス魅せられるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山練習しなきゃ◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/11/04/7027923/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手のひらを太陽に透かしてみれば。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな歌を歌いたくなるような写真！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地平線が綺麗〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さりげなく全身のコーディネートを見せています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポンチョ？マント？の中は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デニムなオーバーオール！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/11/04/7027923/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポンチョ？マント？で遊んでいた私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"羽ばたく準備は出来ている！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛ぶぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空を飛びたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/11/04/7027923/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つの日傘に入るみりあと私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人数も多いからね◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嵩張るし◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"傘は背の高い人が持った方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互いが楽だと思うの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が思うに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショットでした〜( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなMVになっているのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になった方は！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"h